<section class="page-hero technology-insights-hero">
<p class="eyebrow">Technology &amp; Digital Growth</p>
<h1>Understand Technology. Build Confidence. Move Forward.</h1>
<p>You do not need complicated language or expert knowledge to understand the digital world. Begin with one clear idea, one useful skill, and one courageous step.</p>
</section>
<main id="main-content">
