<h2 id="tech-feature-title">Why Technology Is Necessary in Today’s World</h2>
<p>Technology is already shaping how you learn, work, communicate, do business, and solve problems. This article speaks directly to you as a learner and shows why your next digital skill matters.</p>
<blockquote>“You do not need to become an expert today. You only need the courage to begin.”</blockquote>
<a class="btn" href="why-technology-is-necessary.html">Read the Article</a>
</article>
