<div class="tech-focus-grid">
<article class="tech-focus-card"><b>01</b><h3>Digital Confidence</h3><p>Messages that help you overcome fear, begin with basic skills, and trust your ability to learn.</p></article>
<article class="tech-focus-card"><b>02</b><h3>Technology in Life</h3><p>Simple explanations of how technology affects education, work, business, communication, and communities.</p></article>
<article class="tech-focus-card"><b>03</b><h3>Skills for the Future</h3><p>Practical direction to help you adapt, keep learning, and use technology to solve real problems.</p></article>
</div>
